    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueEmily",
      "key": "Good_1",
      "field": null,
      "source": "This is so fun to live together! I always thought I'd be single my whole life.",
      "translation": "Společné bydlení je taková zábava! Vždycky jsem si myslela, že zůstanu celý život svobodná.",
      "sourceSHA256": "e4501c1cc6bec523122f2303141a6f9e18de514c8c35e87a14337671259074e1",
      "translationSHA256": "8b3284ff2541fbb47a31d537bc157ffffcb5f0fe22e6c1bf248941aa57ccb271",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueEmily",
      "key": "Good_2",
      "field": null,
      "source": "It was our destiny to be together... I believe that with all my heart!",
      "translation": "Bylo naším osudem být spolu... Věřím tomu celým srdcem!",
      "sourceSHA256": "476150d2b2b9e3eb44525a58cea967d7b8608458bb9f186d9588eadcd7a496e4",
      "translationSHA256": "fe1848d9342ee468047f834cae483364e65bb0bbd631ec98f2985e502cbf43d4",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueEmily",
      "key": "Good_3",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Thanks for taking me into your home. I love this new life.$4",
      "translation": "Děkuji, že tu s tebou mohu žít. Tenhle nový život miluji.$4",
      "sourceSHA256": "ebf6ff7cef108936c9a28966844a6ab0321391e2354545cc8ef1104249039a43",
      "translationSHA256": "39ddf58996c4285281b86c6a62cfcbe83f1e160f7f88cc06a7965941d1e3aa56",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueEmily",
      "key": "Good_4",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Our vibrational energies are perfectly in tune. Can't you feel it?",
      "translation": "Naše vibrační energie jsou dokonale sladěné. Cítíš to také?",
      "sourceSHA256": "78e58d2756efbe7eebd8b97dd731f153ae096c6037d1c7ccccca82a18be10e93",
      "translationSHA256": "8cb7b474a355768ecbd485340be766c027019dfea37b6d49982da728d01800d2",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueEmily",
      "key": "Good_5",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I was just admiring my wedding amulet... The shell is beautiful! I can feel the pure blue energy radiating from it.$l",
      "translation": "Zrovna jsem obdivovala svůj svatební amulet... Ta lastura je nádherná! Cítím, jak z ní vyzařuje čistá modrá energie.$l",
      "sourceSHA256": "01844de3aac1543fe31f233d867d00e3daf6b9efa29cc906233ce5f0f9d67f31",
      "translationSHA256": "c4db2e3ef290fbf7af964b42f3181405c5e397fd41a9baad86af60e1c38a5986",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueEmily",
      "key": "Good_6",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I had another dream about us last night. We had climbed to the top of a crystal tree, looking down on the most lush and beautiful meadow. I keep having this dream.#$e#I don't know what it means, but I feel that it's a good omen.",
      "translation": "V noci se mi zase zdálo o nás. Vystoupali jsme na vrchol křišťálového stromu a shlíželi na nesmírně bujnou a krásnou louku. Tenhle sen se mi vrací pořád.#$e#Nevím, co znamená, ale cítím, že je to dobré znamení.",
      "sourceSHA256": "c4b45e5475e02099a3eead41b72873c78fd90dd358e20676acc69d513770ffad",
      "translationSHA256": "04d7ec81cd2eb2f90c2b5c4c600171bce3947e56ab0ada9a1457d1bf5632ffaf",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueEmily",
      "key": "Neutral_0",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I hope you'll still like me when I grow old and my hair turns to a dull, faded steel.",
      "translation": "Doufám, že mě budeš milovat, i až zestárnu a mé vlasy získají matný odstín vybledlé oceli.",
      "sourceSHA256": "5ad0e35a2ec1c3b371a13ae00ea31ee74ff01b3067f3adfbfd01c988cd648577",
      "translationSHA256": "898e758f75a738257d2e19432dfa06dc9552751fd7894ce4660098a63ac15ab4",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
